{
  "path": "lua/common/graphpath.lua",
  "module": "Weighted road graph and pathfinding algorithms used by the AI and the navigator. newGraphpath() creates a graph (named nodes, bidirectional edges with length, drivability, lanes, one-way, positions and radii); the methods compute shortest path (Dijkstra with a min-heap), edge-based paths with turn penalty, point-to-point path, random/flee/chase paths, strongly connected components and minor graph. A modder uses it to query the road network (map.getGraphpath()) or build their own graph.",
  "usage": "local gp = newGraphpath()\ngp:edge('a', 'b', 7)\ngp:edge('b', 'c', 3)\nprint(table.concat(gp:getPath('a', 'c'), '->'))  -- a->b->c",
  "notes": [
    "The module is returned by require('graphpath') with two functions: newGraphpath and newMinheap. There is no global newGraphpath unless another file defines it (the example in the header uses it as a global).",
    "Two families of edges: edge(sp, ep, dist) creates simple edges (len only); uniEdge/bidiEdge create rich data shared by both directions in graph[a][b] and graph[b][a] (same tables). Only bidiEdge assigns eId (edge identifier, two consecutive identifiers per edge, one per direction).",
    "The advanced algorithms (getPointNodePath, getFilteredPath, getEdgePath, getPathT...) assume rich edges: drivability, inNode, oneWay, gated, lanes, plus node positions and radii. They will fail (arithmetic on nil) on a graph created with edge() alone.",
    "Paths are arrays of node names ordered from the source to the goal; search functions return {} if a node is unknown or unreachable (unless stated otherwise).",
    "dirMult: cost multiplier for traversing a one-way edge against its direction (typical value 1e3-1e4; nil or 1 = no penalty).",
    "cutOffDrivability / penaltyAboveCutoff / penaltyBelowCutoff: roads whose drivability is <= cutOffDrivability have their cost multiplied by penaltyBelowCutoff (default 10000), the others by penaltyAboveCutoff (default 1).",
    "Edge fields: len (length m), drivability (0..1), speedLimit, lanes (string of '+' and '-' per lane, '+' in the direction inNode to outNode), oneWay, gated, inNode/outNode, inPos/outPos, inRadius/outRadius, eId.",
    "The min-heap (minheap) is shared at module level (local variable 'que') by most searches: these searches are not reentrant, except getPointToPointPathJob which creates its own heap.",
    "Minor bug: newGraphpath ignores its edgeCount parameter.",
    "Probable bug: in getFleePath and getRandomPathG, visited is initialized with {startNode = 0.2}, i.e. with the literal key 'startNode' and not the value of the variable startNode; the start node is therefore not penalized.",
    "No call to the C++ engine: pure Lua module. Uses globals from other files: vec3, square, clamp, sign2, tableSize, tableKeys, profilerPushEvent/PopEvent."
  ],
  "fields": {},
  "functions": {
    "newGraphpath": {
      "desc": "Creates an empty graph. The parameters are only used to pre-allocate the tables.",
      "params": {
        "nodeCount": {
          "type": "integer|nil",
          "desc": "Expected number of nodes (pre-allocation)."
        },
        "edgeCount": {
          "type": "integer|nil",
          "desc": "Ignored by the code."
        }
      },
      "returns": [
        {
          "type": "table",
          "desc": "Graphpath object (fields graph, positions, radius, edgeListCount)."
        }
      ],
      "internal": false
    },
    "newMinheap": {
      "desc": "Creates a min-heap (priority queue) with the keys in the table itself and the values in vals.",
      "params": {},
      "returns": [
        {
          "type": "table",
          "desc": "minheap object."
        }
      ],
      "internal": false
    }
  },
  "classes": {
    "minheap": {
      "desc": "Priority queue with the minimum numeric key at the head. Fields: length, vals; the keys are stored at indices 1..length of the table.",
      "functions": {
        "insert": {
          "desc": "Inserts the value v with the key k.",
          "params": {
            "k": {
              "type": "number",
              "desc": "Key (priority, smallest comes out first)."
            },
            "v": {
              "type": "any",
              "desc": "Associated value."
            }
          }
        },
        "pop": {
          "desc": "Removes and returns the element with the minimum key.",
          "params": {},
          "returns": [
            {
              "type": "number|nil",
              "desc": "Key (nil if empty)."
            },
            {
              "type": "any",
              "desc": "Associated value."
            }
          ]
        },
        "peekKey": {
          "desc": "Minimum key without removing (nil if empty).",
          "params": {},
          "returns": [
            {
              "type": "number|nil",
              "desc": "Minimum key."
            }
          ]
        },
        "peekVal": {
          "desc": "Value of the minimum key without removing.",
          "params": {},
          "returns": [
            {
              "type": "any",
              "desc": "Value."
            }
          ]
        },
        "empty": {
          "desc": "Tells whether the heap is empty.",
          "params": {},
          "returns": [
            {
              "type": "boolean",
              "desc": "true if empty."
            }
          ]
        },
        "clear": {
          "desc": "Empties the heap (keeps the table).",
          "params": {}
        }
      }
    },
    "Graphpath": {
      "desc": "Undirected graph of nodes identified by keys (strings), with tables graph[n1][n2] = edge data, positions[n] (vec3), radius[n] (road width/half-width).",
      "functions": {
        "export": {
          "desc": "Exports the graph in compact form (one entry per edge, no duplicates) for saving or sending to another VM.",
          "params": {
            "edgeCount": {
              "type": "integer|nil",
              "desc": "Expected number of edges (pre-allocation)."
            }
          },
          "returns": [
            {
              "type": "table",
              "desc": "{edgeData, positions, radius, edgeDataCount, nodeCount}."
            }
          ]
        },
        "import": {
          "desc": "Rebuilds the graph from the format produced by export (uses inNode/outNode/eId of the edges) and the edge index.",
          "params": {
            "graphData": {
              "type": "table",
              "desc": "Export data."
            }
          }
        },
        "clear": {
          "desc": "Replaces the graph table with an empty table (positions and radii kept).",
          "params": {}
        },
        "edge": {
          "desc": "Adds a simple edge from sp to ep (len = dist) and creates ep if absent. Only one direction is stored (graph[sp][ep]).",
          "params": {
            "sp": {
              "type": "any",
              "desc": "Start node."
            },
            "ep": {
              "type": "any",
              "desc": "End node."
            },
            "dist": {
              "type": "number|nil",
              "desc": "Length/cost (default 1)."
            }
          }
        },
        "uniEdge": {
          "desc": "Adds a rich edge shared by both directions, without an edge identifier (no eId).",
          "params": {
            "inNode": {
              "type": "any",
              "desc": "Entry node of the edge."
            },
            "outNode": {
              "type": "any",
              "desc": "Exit node."
            },
            "dist": {
              "type": "number|nil",
              "desc": "Length (default 1)."
            },
            "drivability": {
              "type": "number|nil",
              "desc": "Drivability of the road (1 = ideal)."
            },
            "speedLimit": {
              "type": "number|nil",
              "desc": "Speed limit."
            },
            "lanes": {
              "type": "string|nil",
              "desc": "Lanes string ('+' direction inNode->outNode, '-' reverse)."
            },
            "oneWay": {
              "type": "boolean|nil",
              "desc": "One-way (inNode to outNode)."
            },
            "gated": {
              "type": "number|boolean|nil",
              "desc": "Gate flag (value used as a number in the getPathT calculations)."
            },
            "inPos": {
              "type": "vec3|nil",
              "desc": "Specific position of the inNode end."
            },
            "inRad": {
              "type": "number|nil",
              "desc": "Radius at inNode."
            },
            "outPos": {
              "type": "vec3|nil",
              "desc": "Specific position at outNode."
            },
            "outRad": {
              "type": "number|nil",
              "desc": "Radius at outNode."
            }
          }
        },
        "bidiEdge": {
          "desc": "Like uniEdge but also assigns an edge identifier eId (two consecutive identifiers per edge, one per direction); required for getEdgePath and the edge index.",
          "params": {
            "inNode": {
              "type": "any",
              "desc": "Entry node."
            },
            "outNode": {
              "type": "any",
              "desc": "Exit node."
            },
            "dist": {
              "type": "number|nil",
              "desc": "Length (default 1)."
            },
            "drivability": {
              "type": "number|nil",
              "desc": "Drivability."
            },
            "speedLimit": {
              "type": "number|nil",
              "desc": "Speed limit."
            },
            "lanes": {
              "type": "string|nil",
              "desc": "Lanes string."
            },
            "oneWay": {
              "type": "boolean|nil",
              "desc": "One-way."
            },
            "gated": {
              "type": "number|boolean|nil",
              "desc": "Gate."
            },
            "inPos": {
              "type": "vec3|nil",
              "desc": "Position at inNode."
            },
            "inRad": {
              "type": "number|nil",
              "desc": "Radius at inNode."
            },
            "outPos": {
              "type": "vec3|nil",
              "desc": "Position at outNode."
            },
            "outRad": {
              "type": "number|nil",
              "desc": "Radius at outNode."
            }
          }
        },
        "generateEdgeIndex": {
          "desc": "Builds the edgeList table (eId to node) from the edges created by bidiEdge.",
          "params": {}
        },
        "getEdgeIdFromNodes": {
          "desc": "Identifier of the directed edge from fromNode to toNode (eId for the direction inNode->outNode, eId+1 for the reverse).",
          "params": {
            "fromNode": {
              "type": "any",
              "desc": "Start node."
            },
            "toNode": {
              "type": "any",
              "desc": "End node."
            }
          },
          "returns": [
            {
              "type": "integer",
              "desc": "Edge identifier."
            }
          ]
        },
        "getNodesFromEdgeId": {
          "desc": "Inverse of getEdgeIdFromNodes: returns the two nodes of the directed edge (start, end).",
          "params": {
            "eId": {
              "type": "integer",
              "desc": "Edge identifier."
            }
          },
          "returns": [
            {
              "type": "any",
              "desc": "Start node."
            },
            {
              "type": "any",
              "desc": "End node."
            }
          ]
        },
        "getEdgePositions": {
          "desc": "Positions of the ends of an edge: the edge-specific position (inPos/outPos) if it exists, otherwise the node position.",
          "params": {
            "n1id": {
              "type": "any",
              "desc": "First node."
            },
            "n2id": {
              "type": "any",
              "desc": "Second node."
            }
          },
          "returns": [
            {
              "type": "vec3",
              "desc": "Position on the n1id side."
            },
            {
              "type": "vec3",
              "desc": "Position on the n2id side."
            }
          ]
        },
        "getEdgeRadii": {
          "desc": "Radii at the ends of an edge (the edge's own radius, otherwise the node's).",
          "params": {
            "n1id": {
              "type": "any",
              "desc": "First node."
            },
            "n2id": {
              "type": "any",
              "desc": "Second node."
            }
          },
          "returns": [
            {
              "type": "number",
              "desc": "Radius on the n1id side."
            },
            {
              "type": "number",
              "desc": "Radius on the n2id side."
            }
          ]
        },
        "setPointPosition": {
          "desc": "Sets the position of a node.",
          "params": {
            "p": {
              "type": "any",
              "desc": "Node."
            },
            "pos": {
              "type": "vec3",
              "desc": "Position."
            }
          }
        },
        "setPointPositionRadius": {
          "desc": "Sets the position and radius of a node.",
          "params": {
            "p": {
              "type": "any",
              "desc": "Node."
            },
            "pos": {
              "type": "vec3",
              "desc": "Position."
            },
            "radius": {
              "type": "number",
              "desc": "Radius."
            }
          }
        },
        "setNodeRadius": {
          "desc": "Sets the radius of a node.",
          "params": {
            "node": {
              "type": "any",
              "desc": "Node."
            },
            "radius": {
              "type": "number",
              "desc": "Radius."
            }
          }
        },
        "scc": {
          "desc": "Strongly connected components (Tarjan) following only edges with drivability exactly 1. If v is given, computes only from v.",
          "params": {
            "v": {
              "type": "any|nil",
              "desc": "Optional start node."
            }
          },
          "returns": [
            {
              "type": "table[]",
              "desc": "List of components; each component is a node=true dictionary with the number of nodes in the key [0]."
            }
          ]
        },
        "graphMinor": {
          "desc": "Contracts degree-2 nodes: the result contains only dead ends and intersections. minor[a][b] is the ordered array of original nodes linking a and b (ends included), symmetric in minor[b][a].",
          "params": {},
          "returns": [
            {
              "type": "table",
              "desc": "Minor graph."
            }
          ]
        },
        "getPath": {
          "desc": "Shortest path (Dijkstra) between two nodes minimizing the sum of len; one-way edges traversed against their direction are multiplied by dirMult.",
          "params": {
            "start": {
              "type": "any",
              "desc": "Start node."
            },
            "goal": {
              "type": "any",
              "desc": "End node."
            },
            "dirMult": {
              "type": "number|nil",
              "desc": "Wrong-way penalty (default 1)."
            }
          },
          "returns": [
            {
              "type": "table",
              "desc": "List of nodes; {} if start or goal is unknown."
            }
          ]
        },
        "edgeLanesInDirection": {
          "desc": "Number of lanes of the edge going from fromNode to toNode (counts the '+' or '-' of the lanes string depending on the direction).",
          "params": {
            "fromNode": {
              "type": "any",
              "desc": "Start node."
            },
            "toNode": {
              "type": "any",
              "desc": "End node."
            }
          },
          "returns": [
            {
              "type": "integer",
              "desc": "Number of lanes in this direction."
            }
          ]
        },
        "getEdgePath": {
          "desc": "Shortest path over edges (states = directed edges) with turn penalties (left/right stronger at intersections, U-turn heavily penalized depending on road width). Starts from the edge bNode to fNode; the result is a list of nodes.",
          "params": {
            "bNode": {
              "type": "any",
              "desc": "Node behind."
            },
            "fNode": {
              "type": "any",
              "desc": "Node ahead (start direction)."
            },
            "goal": {
              "type": "any",
              "desc": "Goal node."
            },
            "dirMult": {
              "type": "number|nil",
              "desc": "Wrong-way penalty (at least 1)."
            }
          },
          "returns": [
            {
              "type": "table|nil",
              "desc": "List of nodes; nil if the nodes do not form a valid edge or if the goal is unknown."
            }
          ]
        },
        "getPointNodePath": {
          "desc": "Shortest path between a point (vec3) and a node, in either direction (if start is a cdata/vec3, the path is computed from the target node and reversed). Penalizes the distance between the point and the road and can end in the middle of an edge (first element of the array = node of the edge that contains the projection of the point).",
          "params": {
            "start": {
              "type": "any",
              "desc": "Node or vec3."
            },
            "target": {
              "type": "any",
              "desc": "Vec3 or node (the other side)."
            },
            "cutOffDrivability": {
              "type": "number|nil",
              "desc": "Drivability threshold (default 0)."
            },
            "dirMult": {
              "type": "number|nil",
              "desc": "Wrong-way penalty."
            },
            "penaltyAboveCutoff": {
              "type": "number|nil",
              "desc": "Multiplier above the threshold (default 1)."
            },
            "penaltyBelowCutoff": {
              "type": "number|nil",
              "desc": "Multiplier below the threshold (default 10000)."
            },
            "wZ": {
              "type": "number|nil",
              "desc": "Weight of the vertical offset in the distance (default 4)."
            }
          },
          "returns": [
            {
              "type": "table",
              "desc": "Node path ({} if start is unknown)."
            }
          ]
        },
        "_getPointToPointPathImpl": {
          "desc": "Implementation of the point-to-point search: several possible access nodes/edges at the source (provided by the iterator iter) and exit toward targetPos by projection onto the edges; optional yieldFn called at each iteration.",
          "params": {
            "sourcePos": {
              "type": "vec3",
              "desc": "Source position."
            },
            "iter": {
              "type": "function",
              "desc": "Iterator returning (node or {n1,n2}, cost, xnorm) from nearest to farthest."
            },
            "targetPos": {
              "type": "vec3",
              "desc": "Target position."
            },
            "cutOffDrivability": {
              "type": "number|nil",
              "desc": "Drivability threshold (default 0)."
            },
            "dirMult": {
              "type": "number|nil",
              "desc": "Wrong-way penalty."
            },
            "penaltyAboveCutoff": {
              "type": "number|nil",
              "desc": "Default 1."
            },
            "penaltyBelowCutoff": {
              "type": "number|nil",
              "desc": "Default 10000."
            },
            "wZ": {
              "type": "number|nil",
              "desc": "Vertical weight (default 1)."
            },
            "yieldFn": {
              "type": "function|nil",
              "desc": "Called at each iteration."
            }
          },
          "returns": [
            {
              "type": "table",
              "desc": "Path (nodes); {} if impossible or if the direct path is better."
            }
          ],
          "internal": true
        },
        "getPointToPointPath": {
          "desc": "Path between two positions via the road network (synchronous version of _getPointToPointPathImpl).",
          "params": {
            "sourcePos": {
              "type": "vec3",
              "desc": "Source position."
            },
            "iter": {
              "type": "function",
              "desc": "Iterator of nodes/edges near the source."
            },
            "targetPos": {
              "type": "vec3",
              "desc": "Target position."
            },
            "cutOffDrivability": {
              "type": "number|nil",
              "desc": "Drivability threshold."
            },
            "dirMult": {
              "type": "number|nil",
              "desc": "Wrong-way penalty."
            },
            "penaltyAboveCutoff": {
              "type": "number|nil",
              "desc": "Multiplier above the threshold."
            },
            "penaltyBelowCutoff": {
              "type": "number|nil",
              "desc": "Multiplier below the threshold."
            },
            "wZ": {
              "type": "number|nil",
              "desc": "Vertical weight."
            }
          },
          "returns": [
            {
              "type": "table",
              "desc": "Node path."
            }
          ]
        },
        "getPointToPointPathJob": {
          "desc": "Like getPointToPointPath but yields (job.yield) every 350 iterations (or global_yieldInterval) so as not to block the game; to be called from a jobsystem job.",
          "params": {
            "job": {
              "type": "table|nil",
              "desc": "core_jobsystem job (with .yield)."
            },
            "sourcePos": {
              "type": "vec3",
              "desc": "Source position."
            },
            "iter": {
              "type": "function",
              "desc": "Iterator of nodes/edges near the source."
            },
            "targetPos": {
              "type": "vec3",
              "desc": "Target position."
            },
            "cutOffDrivability": {
              "type": "number|nil",
              "desc": "Drivability threshold."
            },
            "dirMult": {
              "type": "number|nil",
              "desc": "Wrong-way penalty."
            },
            "penaltyAboveCutoff": {
              "type": "number|nil",
              "desc": "Multiplier above the threshold."
            },
            "penaltyBelowCutoff": {
              "type": "number|nil",
              "desc": "Multiplier below the threshold."
            },
            "wZ": {
              "type": "number|nil",
              "desc": "Vertical weight."
            }
          },
          "returns": [
            {
              "type": "table",
              "desc": "Node path."
            }
          ]
        },
        "numOfEdgeLanes": {
          "desc": "Total number of lanes of an edge and number of lanes in the given inNode->outNode direction; if lanes is absent, infers them from the radii (3.45 m per lane).",
          "params": {
            "inNode": {
              "type": "any",
              "desc": "Start node."
            },
            "outNode": {
              "type": "any",
              "desc": "End node."
            }
          },
          "returns": [
            {
              "type": "integer",
              "desc": "Total lanes."
            },
            {
              "type": "integer",
              "desc": "Lanes in the inNode->outNode direction."
            }
          ]
        },
        "getPathT": {
          "desc": "Picks a weighted random path for AI traffic from start, favoring drivable roads, direction continuity and capacity (lane flow); stops at pathLenLim meters from mePos, up to 10 randomly drawn candidates.",
          "params": {
            "start": {
              "type": "any",
              "desc": "Start node."
            },
            "mePos": {
              "type": "vec3",
              "desc": "Reference position for the distance."
            },
            "pathLenLim": {
              "type": "number",
              "desc": "Minimum path distance (m)."
            },
            "illegalDirPenalty": {
              "type": "number|nil",
              "desc": "Not used in the code."
            },
            "initDir": {
              "type": "vec3",
              "desc": "Initial direction (x, y used)."
            }
          },
          "returns": [
            {
              "type": "table",
              "desc": "Node path ({} if start is unknown)."
            }
          ]
        },
        "getFlows": {
          "desc": "Forward and backward flow (capacity) of a directed edge, inferred from the exit node's radius distributed over the lanes.",
          "params": {
            "inNode": {
              "type": "any",
              "desc": "Entry node."
            },
            "outNode": {
              "type": "any",
              "desc": "Exit node."
            }
          },
          "returns": [
            {
              "type": "number",
              "desc": "Flow in the inNode->outNode direction."
            },
            {
              "type": "number",
              "desc": "Flow in the reverse direction."
            }
          ]
        },
        "getPathTWithState": {
          "desc": "Variant of getPathT that reuses the previous path as state to continue consistently (the last node of the previous path must be start).",
          "params": {
            "start": {
              "type": "any",
              "desc": "Start node."
            },
            "mePos": {
              "type": "vec3|nil",
              "desc": "Reference position (default position of start)."
            },
            "pathLenLim": {
              "type": "number|nil",
              "desc": "Minimum path length (default 150)."
            },
            "state": {
              "type": "vec3|table|nil",
              "desc": "Initial direction (vec3) or previous path (list of nodes)."
            }
          },
          "returns": [
            {
              "type": "table",
              "desc": "Node path ({} if impossible)."
            }
          ]
        },
        "getFilteredPath": {
          "desc": "Shortest path between two nodes with drivability (threshold) and wrong-way penalties.",
          "params": {
            "start": {
              "type": "any",
              "desc": "Start node."
            },
            "goal": {
              "type": "any",
              "desc": "End node."
            },
            "cutOffDrivability": {
              "type": "number|nil",
              "desc": "Threshold (default 0)."
            },
            "dirMult": {
              "type": "number|nil",
              "desc": "Wrong-way penalty."
            },
            "penaltyAboveCutoff": {
              "type": "number|nil",
              "desc": "Default 1."
            },
            "penaltyBelowCutoff": {
              "type": "number|nil",
              "desc": "Default 10000."
            }
          },
          "returns": [
            {
              "type": "table",
              "desc": "Node path."
            }
          ]
        },
        "spanMap": {
          "desc": "Shortest path where the cost of each edge is multiplied by edgeDict['a\\0b'] (default 1e20 if absent), with a strong penalty (x300) for heading back to nodeBehind from the source; used to cover a set of edges.",
          "params": {
            "source": {
              "type": "any",
              "desc": "Start node."
            },
            "nodeBehind": {
              "type": "any",
              "desc": "Node behind the source."
            },
            "target": {
              "type": "any",
              "desc": "Goal node."
            },
            "edgeDict": {
              "type": "table<string, number>",
              "desc": "Per-edge coefficient, key node..'\\0'..child."
            },
            "dirMult": {
              "type": "number|nil",
              "desc": "Wrong-way penalty."
            }
          },
          "returns": [
            {
              "type": "table",
              "desc": "Node path."
            }
          ]
        },
        "getPathAwayFrom": {
          "desc": "Path to goal that avoids stayAwayPos: the edge cost is weighted by (distance to mePos / distance to stayAwayPos).",
          "params": {
            "start": {
              "type": "any",
              "desc": "Start node."
            },
            "goal": {
              "type": "any",
              "desc": "Goal node."
            },
            "mePos": {
              "type": "vec3",
              "desc": "Agent position."
            },
            "stayAwayPos": {
              "type": "vec3",
              "desc": "Position to avoid."
            },
            "dirMult": {
              "type": "number|nil",
              "desc": "Wrong-way penalty."
            }
          },
          "returns": [
            {
              "type": "table",
              "desc": "Node path."
            }
          ]
        },
        "getMaxNodeAround": {
          "desc": "Walks the graph within a radius radius around start and returns the farthest node, or the most advanced one according to the direction dir.",
          "params": {
            "start": {
              "type": "any",
              "desc": "Start node."
            },
            "radius": {
              "type": "number",
              "desc": "Search radius (m)."
            },
            "dir": {
              "type": "vec3|nil",
              "desc": "If provided, score = projection onto dir instead of the squared distance."
            }
          },
          "returns": [
            {
              "type": "any|nil",
              "desc": "Node found, nil if start is unknown."
            }
          ]
        },
        "getBranchNodesAround": {
          "desc": "Depth-first traversal within a radius around start; returns the intersections (nodes with at least 2 new neighbors) and their links.",
          "params": {
            "start": {
              "type": "any",
              "desc": "Start node."
            },
            "maxRadius": {
              "type": "number|nil",
              "desc": "Max radius in m (default 1000)."
            }
          },
          "returns": [
            {
              "type": "table[]|nil",
              "desc": "List of {node, links, sqDist}; nil if start is unknown."
            }
          ]
        },
        "getChasePath": {
          "desc": "Path to chase a target: picks the node ahead according to the target's position/velocity and computes a path to the target's node.",
          "params": {
            "nodeBehind": {
              "type": "any",
              "desc": "Node behind the chaser."
            },
            "nodeAhead": {
              "type": "any",
              "desc": "Node ahead of the chaser."
            },
            "targetNodeBehind": {
              "type": "any",
              "desc": "Node behind the target."
            },
            "targetNodeAhead": {
              "type": "any",
              "desc": "Node ahead of the target."
            },
            "mePos": {
              "type": "vec3",
              "desc": "Chaser position."
            },
            "meVel": {
              "type": "vec3",
              "desc": "Chaser velocity."
            },
            "targetPos": {
              "type": "vec3",
              "desc": "Target position."
            },
            "targetVel": {
              "type": "vec3",
              "desc": "Target velocity."
            },
            "dirMult": {
              "type": "number|nil",
              "desc": "Wrong-way penalty."
            }
          },
          "returns": [
            {
              "type": "table",
              "desc": "Node path."
            }
          ]
        },
        "getFleePath": {
          "desc": "Greedily builds a flee path away from chasePos, with direction randomization, until exceeding pathLenLimit.",
          "params": {
            "startNode": {
              "type": "any",
              "desc": "Start node."
            },
            "initialDir": {
              "type": "vec3",
              "desc": "Initial direction."
            },
            "chasePos": {
              "type": "vec3",
              "desc": "Chaser position."
            },
            "pathLenLimit": {
              "type": "number|nil",
              "desc": "Length to reach in m (default 100)."
            },
            "rndDirCoef": {
              "type": "number|nil",
              "desc": "Magnitude of the direction randomization (default 0)."
            },
            "rndDistCoef": {
              "type": "number|nil",
              "desc": "Growth of the randomization with distance (default 0.05, max 1)."
            }
          },
          "returns": [
            {
              "type": "table|nil",
              "desc": "Node path; nil if startNode is unknown."
            }
          ]
        },
        "getRandomPathG": {
          "desc": "Greedily builds a random path that favors direction continuity, until exceeding pathLenLimit.",
          "params": {
            "startNode": {
              "type": "any",
              "desc": "Start node."
            },
            "initialDir": {
              "type": "vec3",
              "desc": "Initial direction."
            },
            "pathLenLimit": {
              "type": "number|nil",
              "desc": "Length to reach in m (default 100)."
            },
            "rndDirCoef": {
              "type": "number|nil",
              "desc": "Direction randomization (default 0)."
            },
            "rndDistCoef": {
              "type": "number|nil",
              "desc": "Randomization growth (default 0.05)."
            },
            "oneway": {
              "type": "boolean|nil",
              "desc": "If false, does not penalize one-way streets taken the wrong way (default true: penalized)."
            }
          },
          "returns": [
            {
              "type": "table|nil",
              "desc": "Node path; nil if startNode is unknown."
            }
          ]
        },
        "getRandomPath": {
          "desc": "Random path (up to 5 candidates over 300 m, weighted draw) with a bias toward edge collinearity; prevents making a U-turn toward nodeBehind.",
          "params": {
            "nodeAhead": {
              "type": "any",
              "desc": "Node ahead."
            },
            "nodeBehind": {
              "type": "any",
              "desc": "Node behind."
            },
            "dirMult": {
              "type": "number|nil",
              "desc": "Wrong-way penalty."
            }
          },
          "returns": [
            {
              "type": "table",
              "desc": "Node path ({} if a node is unknown)."
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    }
  }
}
